---
---

<section style="padding: 80px 0; background: #F5F5F7;">
  <div style="max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 80px;">
    <div style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 50px;">
      <h2 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: #000000;">Nuestra Filosofía</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px;">
      <div class="philosophy-card">
        <div class="philosophy-icon-wrapper">
          <i class="bi bi-recycle philosophy-icon"></i>
        </div>
        <span style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; color: #000; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">SOSTENIBLE</span>
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: #6E6E6E; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Reducimos el desperdicio electrónico mediante soluciones reales, no reemplazos innecesarios.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="philosophy-card">
        <div class="philosophy-icon-wrapper">
          <i class="bi bi-eye philosophy-icon"></i>
        </div>
        <span style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; color: #000; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">TRANSPARENTE</span>
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: #6E6E6E; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Pagas por la reparación real. Decimos las cosas como son, con ética y claridad.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="philosophy-card">
        <div class="philosophy-icon-wrapper">
          <i class="bi bi-gear philosophy-icon"></i>
        </div>
        <span style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; color: #000; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">PRECISIÓN TÉCNICA</span>
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9375rem; color: #6E6E6E; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">Somos especialistas. Cada reparación se realiza con conocimiento profundo y herramientas adecuadas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@800;900&display=swap');

  .philosophy-card {
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .philosophy-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
  }

  .philosophy-icon-wrapper {
    height: 50px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .philosophy-icon {
    font-size: 45px;
    color: #000000;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
  }

  .philosophy-card:hover .philosophy-icon {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    div[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr"] {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 30px !important;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    div[style*="padding: 0 80px"] {
      padding: 0 24px !important;
    }

    section[style*="padding: 80px 0"] {
      padding: 50px 0 !important;
    }

    div[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr"] {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 24px !important;
    }

    h2[style*="font-size: clamp"] {
      font-size: 1.8rem !important;
    }

    .philosophy-icon {
      font-size: 36px !important;
    }
  }
</style>
